        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF142 adds support for <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Integrity-Policy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrity-Policy</a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Integrity-Policy-Report-Only\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrity-Policy-Report-Only</a> on nightly in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1976656\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1976656</a> [behind pref <code class=\"notranslate\">security.integrity_policy.enabled</code> enabled in nightly).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds an experimental feature section and an entry in the FF142 release notes.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3302143499\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40667\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40667/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40667\">#40667</a></p>",
