        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF142 adds support for <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Animation/overallProgress\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Animation.overallProgress</code></a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1834878\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1834878</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This just adds a release note.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work covered in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3302154569\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40668\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40668/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40668\">#40668</a></p>",
