            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45551?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Replaces the use of <code class=\"notranslate\">xargs</code> in github actions with a bash array</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">xargs</code> usage considered harmful</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">File names with special characters an spaces caused the action to fail.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fixes <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1980970\" rel=\"nofollow\">this issue</a></p>",
