        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This updates the  <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Element/outerHTML\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Element.outerHTML</code> </a> to show how it is used with TrustedTypes. It is based on the work done in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3242163805\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40423\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40423/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40423\">#40423</a> for <code class=\"notranslate\">innerHTML</code>.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added boilerplate</li>\n<li>Restructured to match current template, such as copying up things that were notes previously.</li>\n<li>Copied in security considerations and shadow dom considerations from the innerHTML and updated appropriately.</li>\n<li>Add TT information, including the new exception and tinyfill.</li>\n<li>Mirrored the innerHTML example behavior</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Part of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2770544982\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37518\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/37518/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/37518\">#37518</a> (tracking issue)</p>",
